e \"..\" row description would then be /storage/emulated/0/Documents/markor, but observed /storage/emulated/0/Documents. So no.\n\nHmm, maybe when tapping Zeta, the app navigated into a different folder than the tapped one (markor)? But the toolbar says Zeta and contents inside.md. Could be that Zeta contains inside.md. And the \"..\" row is a \"home\" shortcut, not the parent. The desc under \"..\" is the home folder path /storage/emulated/0/Documents/markor... which should be \".../Documents\". Hmm.\n\nLet's test Go To: tap Go to button to see \"home\" path and navigation shortcuts."}
